        <body>
            <listPerson>
                <person xml:id="VAR03" sex="2">
                    <persName>
                        <roleName/>
                        <forename>Esther</forename>
                        <surname>Varley</surname>
                        <addName/>
                    </persName>
                    <birth when="1784">
                        <placeName/>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1864"/>
                    <occupation>Artist</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p> There is an entry 'call on Mulready cum Varley' 15.3.1805 which we
                            believe to be Elizabeth Varley, whom William Mulready married. The entry
                            for 13.4.1805 'mrs Varley' at Thos Hope's, we think is not Elizabeth
                            Mulready, but the wife of John Varley DNB 1778-1842 who married Esther
                            Gisborne in 1803 (see Gisborne)  John Varley's brothers Cornelius and John Fleetwood, both in
                            DNB, were as yet unmarried. Thomas Hope DNB 1769-1831 was an
                            "enlightened patron of young and promising artists" </p>
                    </note>
                </person>
            </listPerson>
